{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12161","headline":"送薛判官赴蜀 · 钱起","name":"送薛判官赴蜀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"横笛声转悲，羽觞酣欲别。\n举目叩关远，离心不可说。\n边陲劳帝念，日下降才杰。\n路极巴水长，天衔剑峰缺。\n单车动夙夜，越境正炎节。\n星桥过客稀，火井蒸云热。\n阴符能制胜，千里在坐决。\n始见儒者雄，长缨系余孽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12161.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12161","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}